    "content": "Agentic CyberSec Ops — AI is rapidly evolving and so are the risks\nSecurity built for humans using tools cannot govern AI agents acting autonomously. Every agent is a new identity, a new attack vector, and a new compliance surface. Vikat engineers the agentic intelligence layer your enterprise needs — on top of what you already run.\nHow We Solve It"
