    "id": "page:index-html:how-exposed-is-your-enterprise",
    "page": "index.html",
    "section": "How exposed is your enterprise ?",
    "content": "0 of 4 answered\nAnswer 4 questions about your current security posture. Takes 30 seconds.\nThe Agentic Attack Surface\nEvery AI agent in your enterprise is a new identity, a new privilege escalation vector, and a new compliance surface — acting without human approval.\nDo you have full visibility and governance over every AI agent deployed in your enterprise?\nYes\nNo\nTool Sprawl & Blind Spots\nEnterprises average 45 security tools. SOC, DevSecOps, CloudSec, and IAM operate in silos — no single team owns the full agent chain or correlates signals across it.\nCan your security team correlate threats across agents, cloud, identity, and dev pipelines in real time?\nYes\nNo\nShadow Agents & Governance Gaps\nOver 50% of enterprise AI usage is unsanctioned. Employees deploy agents without IT approval — accessing regulated data with no audit trail.\nDo you know how many unsanctioned AI agents are active in your environment right now?\nYes\nNo\nThe Accountability Gap\nBoards are asking CISOs five questions about AI agent governance. When an agent goes rogue at 2am, who is accountable? Most CISOs cannot answer the first question.\nIf an AI agent caused a breach tonight, do you have an incident response playbook ready?\nYes\nNo\nHow Vikat enables security for the agentic age\n01\nAssess\nKnow your real posture\nWe baseline your AI agent inventory, security maturity, tool gaps, and risk posture across SOC, DevSecOps, CloudSec, and IAM. You can't govern what you can't see — and most enterprises don't know how many agents are deployed, what data they access, or which ones are unsanctioned. Assess gives you that ground truth.\n02\nArchitect\nDesign the governance layer\nWe redesign how security decisions are made, validated, and executed across your enterprise. This means building agent governance frameworks, defining identity and access controls for every AI actor, and architecting the agentic decision layer that sits on top of your existing SIEM, SOAR, IAM, and CSPM stack. Not rip-and-replace — a structural upgrade to what you already run.\n03\nDeploy\nEmbed agentic intelligence\nWe embed our four proprietary AI accelerators — VCommand, VSentinel, VShield, VInsight — into your existing stack. Each product layers autonomous intelligence onto your current tools: risk scoring, performance measurement, runtime guardrails, and workflow optimization. 50+ security integrations. Every action logged, explainable, and compliant.\n04\nOptimize\nMeasure, tune, improve\nSecurity without measurement is security on faith. We continuously track decision quality, automation accuracy, MTTR, and workflow friction — and use that data to refine playbooks, improve response logic, and benchmark your security velocity against industry standards. Measurable ROI within 90 days, by design.\nPartnerships & Certifications\n02 — Agentic Platform Engineering"
