    "content": "100%\nMCP Visibility\nComplete inventory of every MCP server, tool, and agent connection in your environment — sanctioned and shadow — within the first 2 weeks.\n90%+\nUnauthorized Call Reduction\nReduction in unauthorized MCP tool calls through runtime interception, identity enforcement, and action-level guardrails — measured, not estimated.\nDay 90\nMeasurable ROI\nQuantified risk reduction with auditor-ready evidence. Board-reportable metrics on MCP posture, violation trends, and compliance coverage.\nZero\nDisruption to Existing Stack\nNo changes to your agent code, MCP server configs, or tool definitions. Transparent interception layer — shadow mode first, graduated enforcement.\n6–8 wk\nFull Enforcement\nFrom first discovery scan to full runtime enforcement in 6–8 weeks. Not a 6-month program — a consulting-led sprint with platform-powered execution.\n100%\nAudit-Ready Evidence\nFull audit trail for every MCP tool call — who called what, when, with what identity, and what policy governed it. SOC 2, GDPR, HIPAA, EU AI Act ready.\nVikat's Solution\nComplete visibility into every MCP server and destructive capability across your infrastructure.: Architecture"
